  "description": "The Grandurance 40 brings all-road freedom, offering a confident, comfortable ride for new gravel riders and everyday explorers alike. Its durable alloy frame and riveted carbon fork provide a stable platform for pavement, paths and light gravel, backed by geometry that keeps handling predictable and fun.\n\nA Shimano Cues 10 speed drivetrain delivers straightforward, reliable shifting, while hydraulic disc brakes ensure steady control in changing conditions. The bike rolls on wide 45 mm Schwalbe G-One RX tires for added traction and comfort across unpaved routes.\n\nPractical, approachable and ready to expand your riding horizons, the Grandurance 40 invites you to try new roads and escape the ordinary.",
